{"id":14740,"artist":"Jekyll And Hyde Musical","title":"Take Me As I Am","lyrics_plain":"JEKYLL:\nSometimes I see\nPast the horizon\nSure of my way\nWhere I am going\nBut where's the prize\nI have my eyes on?\nWhere?\nThere is just no knowing\nAnd when despair\nTears me in two\nWho can I turn to but you?\nYou know who I am\nTake me as I am\nEMMA:\nLook in my eyes\nWho do you see there?\nSomeone you know\nOr just a stranger?\nIf you are wise\nYou will see me there\nLove is the only danger\nLove, meaning me\nLove, meaning you\nWe'll make that one dream come true\nYou know who I am\nTake me as I am\nJEKYLL & EMMA:\nThough fate won't always do what we desire\nStill we can set the world on fire\nGive me your hand\nGive me your heart\nJEKYLL:\nSwear to me we'll never part\nEMMA:\nWe'll never part\nJEKYLL:\nYou know who I am\nEMMA:\nYou know who I am\nJEKYLL:\nThis is who I am\nJEKYLL & EMMA:\nTake me as I am","lyrics_synced":"[00:14.88] JEKYLL:\n[00:16.64] Sometimes I see\n[00:20.28] Past the horizon\n[00:23.91] Sure of my way\n[00:27.55] Where I am going\n[00:31.19] But where's the prize\n[00:34.82] I have my eyes on?\n[00:38.46] Where?\n[00:41.19] There is just no knowing\n[00:45.73] And when despair\n[00:49.37] Tears me in two\n[00:53.00] Who can I turn to but you?\n[00:58.60] You know who I am\n[01:06.07] Take me as I am\n[01:13.45] EMMA:\n[01:15.24] Look in my eyes\n[01:18.72] Who do you see there?\n[01:22.20] Someone you know\n[01:25.68] Or just a stranger?\n[01:29.15] If you are wise\n[01:32.63] You will see me there\n[01:36.11] Love is the only danger\n[01:43.07] Love, meaning me\n[01:46.55] Love, meaning you\n[01:50.02] We'll make that one dream come true\n[01:55.24] You know who I am\n[02:02.34] Take me as I am\n[02:06.33] JEKYLL & EMMA:\n[02:07.20] Though fate won't always do what we desire\n[02:15.02] Still we can set the world on fire\n[02:23.68] Give me your hand\n[02:27.16] Give me your heart\n[02:28.89] JEKYLL:\n[02:29.33] Swear to me we'll never part\n[02